# Blade of the Swarm puts a card warp exiled (CR 702.185a) on the bottom of its owner's library: Bot1 casts Bygone Colossus
# for its warp cost on turn 1, warp exiles it at the end step, and on turn 3 the Blade's enters trigger puts it on the
# bottom of Bot1's own library, from where it can no longer be cast. Haliya, Guided by Light, warped onto the battlefield
# first, has warp but is not in exile, so the Colossus is the one legal target (CR 115.1). Haliya gains Bot1 1 life as she
# enters and 1 as the Blade does.

